{"id": "EUVD-2025-210880", "enisaUuid": "a27d83ed-d44d-3f3f-9703-fec52ab792f7", "description": "PocketMine-MP before 5.32.1 fails to validate uniqueness of pack UUIDs in ResourcePackClientResponsePacket STATUS_SEND_PACKS handling, allowing authenticated clients to trigger duplicate pack transmissions. Attackers can send multiple copies of valid pack UUIDs in a single packet to exhaust server memory and cause denial of service.", "datePublished": "2026-09-09T13:31:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:21:35", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/pmmp/PocketMine-MP/security/advisories/GHSA-fqqv-56h5-f57g", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/pocketmine-mp-before-5.32.1-denial-of-service-via-resourcepackclientresponsepacket"], "aliases": ["GHSA-j79r-9x96-ppx6", "CVE-2025-71417"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.31, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "63b1d8cf-aa48-324a-821a-5c59d5d3b009", "product": {"name": "PocketMine-MP", "vendor": {"name": "pmmp"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.32.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "156a988d-c732-3b39-9d96-52b0a3f4ae29", "vendor": {"name": "pmmp"}}], "isExploited": false}